# Root BUILD file.
#
# No build targets live directly at the repo root. Each tool/game and the
# shared library defines its own targets in its own BUILD file, addressed
# as //path/to/dir:target (e.g. //shared:term). This file marks the top of
# the Please workspace and is a place for repo-wide targets later, if any
# turn out to be needed (e.g. an aggregate "everything" test target).
